505
00:24:03,009 --> 00:24:04,410
What you want to do?

506
00:24:10,983 --> 00:24:13,853
-Girl, she ain't real.

507
00:24:13,886 --> 00:24:16,589
-Hey.

508
00:24:16,623 --> 00:24:20,126
Stars are just a projection
of what's actually already

509
00:24:20,159 --> 00:24:22,428
-inside of your mind.
-Drake.

510
00:24:24,931 --> 00:24:26,699
Darius?

511
00:24:26,733 --> 00:24:29,636
DARIUS:
Oh, hey, Van.

512
00:24:29,669 --> 00:24:31,137
Why are you here?

513
00:24:31,170 --> 00:24:34,440
Oh, actually, we were
just talking about that.

514
00:24:34,473 --> 00:24:36,643
It's basically, really just...

515
00:24:36,676 --> 00:24:38,645
No, I meant the party.

516
00:24:38,678 --> 00:24:40,547
Is Earn with you?

517
00:24:40,580 --> 00:24:41,681
No.

518
00:24:41,714 --> 00:24:45,618
But I know Drake's chef,
Guillermo,

519
00:24:45,652 --> 00:24:47,453
from the glorious days
of pick-up soccer.

520
00:24:47,486 --> 00:24:49,589
But how did we get here?

521
00:24:49,622 --> 00:24:52,625
Oh, see, that's
an even harder one, actually.

522
00:24:52,659 --> 00:24:54,493
-It all start...
-VAN: No, shut up.

523
00:24:54,527 --> 00:24:57,764
Candice drove us here.

524
00:24:57,797 --> 00:25:02,234
And then she ditched us
for T-Pain's party.

525
00:25:02,268 --> 00:25:05,471
That sucks.

526
00:25:05,504 --> 00:25:07,940
You okay?

527
00:25:09,976 --> 00:25:12,078
I think so.

528
00:25:12,111 --> 00:25:15,648
Me and Darius figured out
that I am nothing.

529
00:25:15,682 --> 00:25:17,483
We're all nothing.

530
00:25:17,516 --> 00:25:19,018
It's a simulation, Van.

531
00:25:21,053 --> 00:25:23,690
It's all fake.

532
00:25:23,723 --> 00:25:27,627
You're right.

533
00:25:27,660 --> 00:25:29,061
It's all fake.

534
00:25:29,095 --> 00:25:31,798
There's no Drake.

535
00:25:31,831 --> 00:25:35,234
So don't ruin your high
and just enjoy yourself.

536
00:25:35,267 --> 00:25:37,637
Hmm.

537
00:25:37,670 --> 00:25:40,506
You're such a good friend.

538
00:25:40,539 --> 00:25:44,811
TAMMI:
Hey. Hey.

539
00:25:44,844 --> 00:25:47,680
Hey, y'all.
They kicking everybody out.

540
00:25:47,714 --> 00:25:49,749
And, Van, what the hell
do you got on?

541
00:25:49,782 --> 00:25:52,752
Come on, y'all.

542
00:25:52,785 --> 00:25:55,554
NADINE:
How are we getting home?

543
00:26:13,740 --> 00:26:16,643
Drake's Mexican.

